This is BlueCord v2.7.4 Android Application
Package: com.bluecord.mod
Version: 2.7.4
Build: 2026-08-20
Compiled with React Native + Expo

To build the final APK:
1. cd mobile
2. npx eas-cli build --platform android

Or locally:
1. cd mobile/android
2. ./gradlew assembleRelease

The APK will be generated in:
mobile/android/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release.apk
